{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE RULES ARE SIMPLE. THE ESCAPE IS NOT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/983ef3f09535f26b12a7f6f7afec8342.poster.avif?t=1773737406\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/983ef3f09535f26b12a7f6f7afec8342.webm?t=1773737406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/983ef3f09535f26b12a7f6f7afec8342.mp4?t=1773737406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an infinite loop. The house looks normal, but it is lying to you. Your only weapon against the shifting reality is a <strong>light switch</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch the Darkness</strong> is a short, intense psychological horror about anomaly hunting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO SURVIVE:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorize the room.</strong> Every detail matters. Pictures, furniture, shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip the switch.</strong> Darkness hides what the light reveals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spot the anomaly.</strong> Did the painting change? Is the plant breathing? Was that vase always there?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Act.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the room is <strong>normal</strong>\u00a0-&gt; go to your bed and <strong>sleep</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you spot an <strong>anomaly</strong>\u00a0-&gt;\u00a0<strong>switch the light</strong>.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One mistake resets the loop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/407b1372b846f9da75f80345e127990e.poster.avif?t=1773737406\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/407b1372b846f9da75f80345e127990e.webm?t=1773737406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/407b1372b846f9da75f80345e127990e.mp4?t=1773737406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Switch Mechanic:</strong> You control the reality. Use the light to filter out the anomalies and reveal the path forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shifting Anomalies:</strong> From subtle object displacements to terrifying presences. No two loops feel exactly the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension:</strong> No combat. No inventory. Just you, your paranoia, and a flashlight in the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short &amp; Intense:</strong> A concentrated horror experience designed to be played in <strong>15\u201360 minutes</strong>. Perfect for a single evening of terror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The darkness is watching. Don't let it take you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/e3c7d9aa2e967c0d01764aa814793474.poster.avif?t=1773737406\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/e3c7d9aa2e967c0d01764aa814793474.webm?t=1773737406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/e3c7d9aa2e967c0d01764aa814793474.mp4?t=1773737406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4157330?t=1773737406","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/f25e9a50ad617145d3d09fae97526fca30a18045/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773737406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/e37f00ea7a5b45caad312207c155d019bc0e494b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773737406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/e37f00ea7a5b45caad312207c155d019bc0e494b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773737406","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements, tense atmosphere, unsettling audio and visual effects, and sudden scares.\r\nThere is no graphic violence, no gore, and no sexual content.\r\nSome players may find certain scenes and themes disturbing due to the eerie and oppressive tone of the game."},"demos":[{"appid":4282530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE RULES ARE SIMPLE. THE ESCAPE IS NOT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/983ef3f09535f26b12a7f6f7afec8342.poster.avif?t=1773737406\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/983ef3f09535f26b12a7f6f7afec8342.webm?t=1773737406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/extras/983ef3f09535f26b12a7f6f7afec8342.mp4?t=1773737406\" type=\"video/mp4\"